{"abstract":"How can didactic approaches and creative approaches enrich teaching and develop both human and professional identity? And what is at stake when we organise the students' learning and formation processes? Presentation 2: Arts-Based Research at The Animation Workshop / VIA UC: Experimental Animation, and Mindful Design Michelle Kranot, Centre for Animation, Film and Digital Processes My abstract (Mathiassen, 2017) is based on several of the professional educational development signatures outlined by VIA. By promoting interdisciplinary thinking, ecological competence and providing both a hand-on and theoretic grounding for creative and innovative practices, I am responding to the call for activation and implementation of critical thinking and practical skills in our offered educations.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Kranot, Michelle"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-792579"],"event":{"end":"2024-11-28","place":"Horsens, dk","start":"2024-11-28","title":"Konference for Professionsuddannelser","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Research designs theory and method","aesthetics design and media","schools courses and institutions"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"via professional education conference","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.via.dk/ws/files/125256670/01_Abstract_MIKR_220824_pdf.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-792579","ids":["via-591085c6-e3e9-4dc3-bda7-dca91957ef28"],"keyword":["aesthetics, design and media","research designs, theory and method","schools, courses and institutions"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":